```html
<!doctype html>
<p><button id="press">Pressed 0 times</button></p>
<script>
let presses = 0;
const press = document.getElementById("press");
press.addEventListener("click", () => { presses += 1; press.textContent = `Pressed ${presses} times`; });
</script>
```

